"<?php
// This is a PHP script that demonstrates how to calculate the factorial of a number using recursion.
function factorial($n) {
    if ($n == 0 || $n == 1) {
        return 1;
    } else {
        return $n * factorial($n - 1);
    }
}

// Example usage:
echo "Factorial of 5 is: " . factorial(5); ?>" Please provide an equivalent Python function to calculate the factorial of a number recursively. Include an example of how to call this function.
